        "Series_overall_design": [
          "Human AT2 cell\u2013derived lung organoids from healthy transplant donors were analysed under two conditions: SITTE11 (Control organoids) and SITTF11 (KRASG12D-transduced organoids). Single-cell RNA sequencing using the 10x Genomics Chromium platform was performed to compare gene expression profiles and identify early fibrotic niche formation and cross-compartmental remodelling induced by KRASG12D activation."
        ],
        "Series_platform_id": [
          "GPL24676"
